// the "d", inside a tilted orbit that ends in a rose satellite. The drawing is
// traced from the brand art. The full logo shades the ribbon with two small
// maps of the art's own shadows and highlights, used as masks over the tone
// colors; the small mark keeps the silhouette and a plain gradient. Colors
// come from the --logo-* tokens in style.css, so each theme tunes them there.
// assets/logo.svg, mark.svg, and favicon.svg are the same drawing in the dark
// theme's colors, for use outside the site.

